 Coincidences and Growth of Boxed Mesh Patterns 
 
 
 Sergey Kitaev
 
 Affiliation:  Department of Mathematics and Statistics, University of StrathclydeGlasgow G1 1XH, United Kingdom 
 
 Email:  sergey.kitaev@strath.ac.uk 
 
    
 Dun Qiu
 
